@startuml
title SPI 送信の流れ
participant App
participant SpiDrv
participant Dma
participant Reg
App -> SpiDrv : Spi_Write(buf)
SpiDrv -> Reg : CR1 = SPE
SpiDrv -> Dma : Dma_Start(tx)
Dma -> Reg : DR = data
Reg --> Dma : TXE
Dma --> SpiDrv : Dma_Done
SpiDrv -> Reg : CR1 = 0
SpiDrv --> App : E_OK
@enduml
